      <tei:div type="colophon" subtype="introduction">
        <tei:p>An original announcement, or hakhrazah, for days of thanksgiving (Purim and Ḥanukkah). Written in the style of other more well-known announcements, like the Sephardic announcement of fasts, or the Italian-rite announcement for Pesaḥ, and to be recited in the same location in the Torah service after the haftarah.</tei:p>
